.el .ds Aq '
.TH portensor-distributed-serve 1  "serve "
.SH NAME
portensor\-distributed\-serve \- Serve a coordinator that assigns shard jobs to polling workers or push agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBserve\fR [\fB\-\-listen\fR] [\fB\-\-token\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\-cert\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-ca\-cert\fR] [\fB\-\-insecure\-tls\fR] [\fB\-\-shards\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-state\fR] [\fB\-\-lease\-secs\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-attempts\fR] [\fB\-\-job\-timeout\-secs\fR] [\fB\-\-agents\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISCAN_ARGS\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serve a coordinator that assigns shard jobs to polling workers or push agents
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-listen\fR \fI<ADDR>\fR [default: 127.0.0.1:9090]
Coordinator listen address. Set \-\-tls\-cert and \-\-tls\-key to serve HTTPS
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<TOKEN>\fR
Bearer token (or PORTENSOR_DISTRIBUTED_TOKEN), at least 16 characters
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\-cert\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
PEM certificate chain for the coordinator\*(Aqs HTTPS listener
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\-key\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
PEM private key for the coordinator\*(Aqs HTTPS listener
.TP
\fB\-\-ca\-cert\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
PEM CA bundle used to verify push\-agent HTTPS certificates
.TP
\fB\-\-insecure\-tls\fR
Accept any push\-agent HTTPS certificate. Use only for testing
.TP
\fB\-\-shards\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 8]
Number of deterministic target shards/jobs
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<FILE>\fR [default: portensor\-distributed.json]
Write the merged report to FILE
.TP
\fB\-\-state\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Durable coordinator state file. Defaults to OUT.state.json
.TP
\fB\-\-lease\-secs\fR \fI<SECS>\fR [default: 300]
Seconds a worker may hold a job without a heartbeat before it is requeued
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-attempts\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 3]
Attempts per shard before it is marked failed
.TP
\fB\-\-job\-timeout\-secs\fR \fI<SECS>\fR [default: 3600]
Per\-job execution timeout in seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-agents\fR \fI<URL,URL>\fR
Agent base URLs for push mode. Omit for polling\-worker mode
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISCAN_ARGS\fR>
Scan command and arguments, prefixed with `scan`
